- **npm audit gate**: any advisory at high or above in a lockfile fails the gate (NA-1; needs the registry, so CI is where it blocks). One with no reachable fix is accepted per package + advisory id in `scripts/audit-allowlist.json`, with a reason and a `review_by` date — never a whole package or severity. Never a bare `npm audit fix`: a targeted update, then read the lockfile diff. → `docs/conventions/node-audit.md`
